        {
          "text": "Ambila Aroni abana bakwe abana boonse ba-Israyeli kuti, Kufumbwa muntu waluzubo lwa-Israyeli, na wabeenzu bakalakala mucisi ca-Israyeli, uuleta cipaizyo cakwe, neciba cipaizyo cakukonkezya neciba cakupa buyo, zyoonse nzebaletela Jehova kukumutentela, ",
